# What the image build does not need.
#
# `docs` is NOT here, and must not be: docs/embed.go embeds the pages into the
# binary, so excluding the directory removes a Go package and the build fails on
# a missing import. It was excluded, and nothing noticed because building the
# image needs a Docker daemon that no check here has.
#
# `*.md` is likewise gone: it matched the repository's own README, which is
# harmless, but the rule is one careless edit away from matching a file the
# build needs.
.git
.github
bin
web/node_modules
web/dist
test
.env
.env.local
*.key
